# Directory globs, not one line per file: the bundled skill is a directory whose file list
# grows, and a per-file rule silently stops covering the next file added. LF matters because
# the embedded policy is digested byte-for-byte, so CRLF would change its reported SHA-256.
skills/** text eol=lf
rust/ai-session-search-core/skills/** text eol=lf
